0" y="86.0" width="0.5" height="11.0" rx="3" fill="var(--series-1)"><title>Native (psycopg) · pk_lookup_customer: 1.85 ms</title></rect><rect x="150" y="99.0" width="0.5" height="11.0" rx="3" fill="var(--series-2)"><title>MCPg server-side · pk_lookup_customer: 2.68 ms</title></rect><text x="140" y="134.0" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="middle" class="cat">orders_status_counts</text><rect x="150" y="122.0" width="4.9" height="11.0" rx="3" fill="var(--series-1)"><title>Native (psycopg) · orders_status_counts: 456 ms</title></rect><rect x="150" y="135.0" width="5.3" height="11.0" rx="3" fill="var(--series-2)"><title>MCPg server-side · orders_status_counts: 495 ms</title></rect><text x="140" y="170.0" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="middle" class="cat">tpch_q1</text><rect x="150" y="158.0" width="328.1" height="11.0" rx="3" fill="var(--series-1)"><title>Native (psycopg) · tpch_q1: 30,376 ms</title></rect><rect x="150" y="171.0" width="328.0" height="11.0" rx="3" fill="var(--series-2)"><title>MCPg server-side · tpch_q1: 30,367 ms</title></rect><text x="140" y="206.0" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="middle" class="cat">tpch_q6</text><rect x="150" y="194.0" width="524.8" height="11.0" rx="3" fill="var(--series-1)"><title>Native (psycopg) · tpch_q6: 48,596 ms</title></rect><rect x="150" y="207.0" width="534.8" height="11.0" rx="3" fill="var(--series-2)"><title>MCPg server-side · tpch_q6: 49,521 ms</title></rect><text x="140" y="242.0" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="middle" class="cat">tpch_q3</text><rect x="150" y="230.0" width="133.9" height="11.0" rx="3" fill="var(--series-1)"><title>Native (psycopg) · tpch_q3: 12,400 ms</title></rect><rect x="150" y="243.0" width="130.5" height="11.0" rx="3" fill="var(--series-2)"><title>MCPg server-side · tpch_q3: 12,087 ms</title></rect><text x="140" y="278.0" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="middle" class="cat">tpch_q5</text><rect x="150" y="266.0" width="248.2" height="11.0" rx="3" fill="var(--series-1)"><ti